        "Content": "Make the right move with your #1 Agency!\r\n\r\nA spacious 3‑bedroom semi‑detached home (approx. 106 m²) located on the south side of Drogheda, just off the Platin Road. This well‑positioned property offers excellent convenience with shops, schools, public transport, and the M1 motorway only minutes away.\r\n\r\nThe house features bright, well‑proportioned rooms, modern comforts, and a practical layout ideal for families, first‑time buyers, or investors.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nGround Floor\r\nPorch: 1.60m x 0.90m\r\nHallway: 1.60m x 3.00m\r\nLiving Room: 3.90m x 4.30m\r\nWC: 1.40m x 1.50m\r\nKitchen/Diner: 5.60m x 4.70m\r\nUtility Room: 2.60m x 1.50m\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nBedroom 1: 2.60m x 3.40m\r\nBedroom 2: 2.90m x 3.40m\r\nBedroom 3 (Main Bedroom): 4.50m x 3.20m\r\nEn‑Suite: 0.90m x 3.20m\r\nFamily Bathroom: 1.70m x 2.30m\r\n\r\nServices\r\nWater: Mains\r\nSewage: Mains\r\nElectricity: Mains\r\nHeating: Gas\r\n\r\nBER Rating\r\nC1\r\n\r\nContact\r\nPlease contact Declan for a viewing"
